@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+## Context
+
+`src/index.ts` already has `isObject` and `setMember` helpers (the latter uses `defineProperty`, safe for `__proto__`), and `applyPatch` clones inputs with `structuredClone`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Implement the RFC recursively: `patch` non-object → `structuredClone(patch)`; otherwise start from a clone-free fresh object copy of `target` if it is an object (else `{}`), then for each own key of `patch` delete on `null` or `setMember(result, key, applyMergePatch(result[key], value))`.
+- Build a fresh object per level and recurse for nested values, so no structure is shared; non-object values are cloned via the non-object branch.
+- Copy untouched target members with `structuredClone` to avoid sharing.
+
+## Risks
+
+- `undefined` or other non-JSON values are not validated; behaviour is unspecified for them.
