@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents, which the library cannot apply today (it only supports RFC 6902 JSON Patch).
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add and export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`, implementing the RFC 7386 `MergePatch` algorithm.
+- The inputs are not mutated and the result shares no mutable structure with them, consistent with `applyPatch`.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: new exported function; `src/index.test.ts`: new tests. No dependency or breaking changes.
